{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>港股先升後倒跌，下試兩周低位。</p><p></p><p>科網股向下，騰訊跌近百分之2，阿里巴巴也偏軟。寧德時代業績差過預期，股價急挫一成。醫藥相關股逆市造好，百濟神州及國藥升百分之3至4。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T05:59:49.882571+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T05:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T08:17:59.050265+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T05:57:42.220677+00:00","content_hash":"4ad081c175c1b605049f82983f6da6da97f03a5e1ddfdac2e65b7b51951d03f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}